OL,3,GNEWSAFree scheme to train more than 100
OL,4,Anew bus drivers                        
OL,6,FMore than 100 new bus drivers are to be
OL,7,Ftrained in a bid to tackle staff       
OL,8,Fshortages and protect local routes in  
OL,9,Fthe north-east of England.             
OL,11,FTraining provider Realise has been     
OL,12,Fgiven a 12-month contract to run the   
OL,13,FRoute to Success programme, which it   
OL,14,Fsaid would build a "sustainable        
OL,15,Fpipeline" of drivers.                  
OL,17,FThe scheme aims to get new recruits    
OL,18,Fbehind the wheel within six weeks. One 
OL,19,Fof them, Dave Anderson, said the       
OL,20,Fprogramme was helping him "make a fresh
OL,21,Fstart" on a new career.                
