OL,3,GNEWSAFree scheme to train more than 100
OL,4,Anew bus drivers                        
OL,6,FMore than 300 people will take part    
OL,7,Fover the next year, with 120 completing
OL,8,Ffull licence training to help them     
OL,9,Fsecure a job and the rest helped to    
OL,10,Fobtain interviews with local bus       
OL,11,Foperators who provide in-house         
OL,12,Ftraining.                              
